-  "命中轮次 = 选项被选中且文本匹配到该条目的轮次（精确归因：输出选项与候选 type+内容 做相似度匹配，被 AI 舍弃的候选不产生命中）；命中率与「期望」对比：期望 = 该条目方向被 AI 采纳输出时的随机点选基准（仅在输出匹配到该条目的轮次按「该条目被匹配到的输出数 ÷ 该轮输出条数」累计；AI 完全自由发挥的轮次不累计期望也不产生命中；统计满 ${0} 轮后按平均每轮点选数校正，多选时基线随之抬高），高于期望越多越值得提权，低于越多越值得降权。单个 config 维度额外显示近 ${1} 轮窗口命中率。参与轮次 = 该条目被抽入候选菜单的轮次（共现归因）：AI 输出为自由文本，被 AI 舍弃的候选也计参与；生成条数按 AI 输出条数计，池子小于请求条数或 AI 自由发挥时，参与条目数可能少于或多于生成条数。": "Hit rounds = rounds where an option was picked AND its text matched this entry (exact attribution: output options are similarity-matched against candidate type+content; discarded candidates produce no hits). Hit rate vs \"expected\": expected = the random-pick baseline for rounds where this entry's direction was adopted in the output (accumulated only in rounds where output matched this entry, as matched outputs ÷ outputs that round; fully free-form rounds accrue neither expected nor hits; once ${0} rounds accumulate, the baseline is corrected by average picks per round, raising it for multi-pick users). The further above expected, the more worth upweighting; the further below, the more worth downweighting. A single-config dimension additionally shows the last ${1}-round window hit rate. Participation rounds = rounds where this entry was drawn into the candidate menu (co-occurrence attribution): AI output is free-form, so discarded candidates still count; generation count follows actual AI output — when the pool is smaller than requested or the AI freestyles, participating entries may be fewer or more than generated options.",
