-  "提示词不再注入上一轮选项（防污染）；生成后自动剔除与上一 AI 楼层/当前楼既有版本重复的选项——同标题需内容也相似才剔除，不同标题按正文相似度（≥阈值）判定。不足时自动补齐（最多 2 轮）。阈值 0-1，越小越严格，0.75 默认。": "Previous-round options are no longer injected into the prompt (anti-contamination); after generation, options duplicating the previous AI floor / existing versions of this floor are removed — same title needs similar content too, different titles are judged by body similarity (≥ threshold). Auto top-up when short (up to 2 rounds). Threshold 0–1, lower is stricter, 0.75 default.",
