-  "为目标在役条数 N 生成落出/补入清单：超过 N 的条目按表现（超额命中率，窗口优先/全量兜底）从末尾落出（软停用、保留统计），空位由替补席（曾停用条目）优先补入，再按探索预算（每次至多一半空位）从未入池条目补入，空缺可再次应用继续填。pinned 与样本不足（参与 <${0} 轮）豁免；点「应用」确认后写入，可撤销。": "Builds a drop-out / fill-in list for a target active count N: entries beyond N drop out from the bottom by performance (excess hit rate; window first, full sample fallback) as soft-disables with stats preserved; open slots go first to the bench (previously disabled entries), then to unpooled entries within the explore budget (at most half the slots per apply — apply again to keep filling). Pinned and low-sample entries (<${0} participation rounds) are exempt; writing happens only after you confirm with \"Apply\", and can be undone.",
