+  "汇总卡片：当前维度（全局 = 所有配置聚合）的累计生成/选择/选择率/活跃天数/池内参与率/最近活动。样本分布：当前维度有效池 ": "Summary card: Cumulative generation/selection/selection rate/active days/pool participation rate/recent activity for the current dimension (global = all configuration aggregates). Sample distribution: current dimension effective pool ",
+  " 条目的样本覆盖——参与 ≥": " Sample coverage of entry – Participation ≥",
+  " 轮命中率才可信（可出建议），不足的只标「样本不足」，充足占比越高优化建议越可信；「参与」指条目进入过生成轮候选菜单（轮次共现），不代表选项一定出现在输出中。趋势：按天统计的生成/选择活动（仅行动选项视图计入，随选中维度），自 v51 起累积，历史不回填。": " Only the round hit rate is credible (recommendations can be made), and the insufficient ones are marked with \"Insufficient Samples\". The higher the sufficient percentage, the more credible the optimization suggestions are; \"Participation\" means that the entry has entered the generation round candidate menu (round co-occurrence), which does not mean that the option must appear in the output. Trends: Generation/selection activity by day (only action options view counts, as dimensions are selected), accumulated since v51, history is not backfilled.",
+  "命中轮次 = 选项被选中且文本匹配到该条目的轮次（精确归因：输出选项与候选 type+内容 做相似度匹配，被 AI 舍弃的候选不产生命中）；命中率与「期望」对比：期望 = 该条目方向被 AI 采纳输出时的随机点选基准（仅在输出匹配到该条目的轮次按「该条目被匹配到的输出数 ÷ 该轮输出条数」累计；AI 完全自由发挥的轮次不累计期望也不产生命中；统计满 ": "Hit round = the round in which the option is selected and the text matches the entry (accurate attribution: similarity matching between the output option and the candidate type+content, the candidate discarded by AI does not generate a hit); hit rate compared with \"expectation\": Expectation = the random click basis when the entry direction is adopted by AI for output (only in the rounds where the output matches the entry, press \"The number of outputs matched by the entry ÷ The number of outputs in this round is accumulated; AI is a completely free round that does not accumulate expectations and does not produce hits; the statistics are full ",
+  " 轮后按平均每轮点选数校正，多选时基线随之抬高），高于期望越多越值得提权，低于越多越值得降权。单个 config 维度额外显示近 ": " After the round, the average number of clicks per round is corrected, and the baseline is raised when there are multiple choices). The more the number is higher than the expectation, the more worthy of a power increase. The more it is lower than the expectation, the more worthy of a power reduction. Single config Dimension Extra Display Near ",
+  " 轮窗口命中率。参与轮次 = 该条目被抽入候选菜单的轮次（共现归因）：AI 输出为自由文本，被 AI 舍弃的候选也计参与；生成条数按 AI 输出条数计，池子小于请求条数或 AI 自由发挥时，参与条目数可能少于或多于生成条数。": " Round window hit rate. Participation round = the round in which the entry is drawn into the candidate menu (co-occurrence attribution): AI outputs as free text, and candidates discarded by AI are also counted as participating; the number of generated entries is calculated based on the number of AI output entries. When the pool is smaller than the number of requested entries or AI plays freely, the number of participating entries may be less than or more than the number of generated entries.",
+  " 全局 = 所有配置混合累计，不代表任何单一场景；建议功能需切换到具体配置维度。": " Global = all configurations are mixed and accumulated, and do not represent any single scenario; it is recommended that the function needs to be switched to the specific configuration dimension.",
+  "仅列出被选择过的条目（精确归因：输出选项文本匹配到该条目才算命中，被 AI 舍弃的候选不产生命中），按命中次数排序。": "Lists only entries that were selected (exact attribution: an output option counts as a hit only when its text matches the entry; discarded candidates produce no hits), sorted by hit count.",
+  "骰子判定战绩（全局维度，不随条目池配置切换）：记录点击选项时的判定结局计数（D100 或骰式）与每日判定次数。随「统计采集」开关积累；不参与条目建议/权重。清空统计时一并清除。": "Dice check record (global dimension, doesn't switch with pool configs): outcome counts for checks rolled on option clicks (D100 or expression) and daily check counts. Accumulates while \"Stat collection\" is on; not used by entry suggestions/weights; cleared together with stats.",
+  "为目标在役条数 N 生成落出/补入清单：超过 N 的条目按表现（超额命中率，窗口优先/全量兜底）从末尾落出（软停用、保留统计），空位由替补席（曾停用条目）优先补入，再按探索预算（每次至多一半空位）从未入池条目补入，空缺可再次应用继续填。pinned 与样本不足（参与 <": "Generate a drop-out/fill-in list for the target number of active items N: Entries exceeding N will drop out from the end (soft deactivation, retained statistics) based on performance (excess hit rate, window priority/full bottom), and the vacancies will be filled by the bench (previously deactivated items) first, and then filled in by unentered entries according to the exploration budget (up to half of the vacancies each time). The vacancies can be applied again to continue filling. pinned with insufficient sample (participation <",
