+  "导出统计为 JSON 便于备份与分析（含全部维度）；清空后所有维度与计数归零，用于重新统计。统计不与角色/聊天绑定，按条目池配置分维度累计。": "Export stats as JSON for backup and analysis (all dimensions); clearing resets every dimension and counter for a fresh start. Stats are not bound to character/chat — they accumulate per pool config dimension.",
+  "未绑定配置": "Unbound config",
+  "统计采集：开启后记录行动选项的生成/选择数据（仅行动选项视图），驱动下方报表与建议引擎；关闭期间零记录，既有历史保留。自动化建议：在统计数据基础上启用建议引擎（提权/降权/回捞，只调权重、永不自动停用条目）、阵容计划与 AI 增强；只想看统计报表的用户保持关闭即可。自动化依赖统计采集，统计关闭时自动化不可用。AI 归因：每轮行动选项生成后，后台异步调 AI 把选项语义匹配到候选条目，结果与本地 Dice 归因 diff 后对称修正统计（默认关：每次生成会多一次 API 请求，且将条目内容送往模型）。AI 建议理由：为当前维度有统计建议的条目生成自然语言解释（打开统计页/切维度按需触发，默认开；仅展示，不改变建议动作与写入链路）。两个 AI 功能均需已配置 API，未配置时静默降级为纯统计。": "Stat collection: when on, records action-option generation/selection data (option views only), driving the reports below and the suggestion engine; while off, nothing is recorded and existing history is kept. Automated suggestions: enables the suggestion engine on top of the stats (upweight / downweight / recovery — adjusts weights only, never auto-disables entries), roster planning and AI enhancements; leave off if you only want the reports. Automation depends on stat collection and is unavailable while stats are off. AI attribution: after each option generation, a background AI call matches options semantically to candidate entries, then symmetrically reconciles stats against the local Dice attribution (off by default: one extra API request per generation, and entry content is sent to the model). AI suggestion reasons: natural-language explanations for entries with suggestions in this dimension (triggered on opening the Stats page / switching dimensions, on by default; display only — doesn't change suggestion actions or the write path). Both AI features need a configured API; without one they silently degrade to pure stats.",
