+  " 条新的行动选项，不得与已给选项及此前方向重复；格式、人称、场景锚定要求不变，先 <thinking> 后 <options>。": " A new action option must not be repeated with the given option and the previous direction; the format, person, and scene anchoring requirements remain unchanged, first <thinking> and then <options>.",
