+  "选项生成失败:": "Options generation failed:",
+  "快速上手": "Get started quickly",
+  "配置 API 并生成第一组选项，三分钟跑通核心链路": "Configure API and generate the first set of options, running through the core link in three minutes",
+  "欢迎使用行动选项": "Welcome to mobile options",
+  "<p><strong>行动选项</strong>会在主线对话之外，单独调用一次 API，根据当前剧情异步生成一组行动选项；点选其中一条，按所选方式进入输入框（直接发送 / 覆盖输入框 / 尾附在末尾 / 插到光标处），不占用楼层、不打断对话节奏。</p>\n<p>上手只需三步：<strong>配置 API → 生成选项 → 点选发送</strong>。条目池等其余功能均开箱即用，之后可从设置面板题首的 <i class=\"fa-solid fa-graduation-cap\"></i> 功能课堂按需深入。跟着做即可，随时可以退出。</p>": "<p><strong> action options </strong> will call API separately outside the main dialogue to asynchronously generate a set of action options based on the current plot; click one of them and enter the input box in the selected way (send directly / overwrite the input box / append to the end / insert at the cursor), without occupying the floor or interrupting the rhythm of the conversation. </p>\nThere are only three steps to get started with <p>: <strong> configuration API → Generate options → Click to send </strong>. Other functions such as the entry pool are available out of the box, and can be further explored as needed from the <i class=\"fa-solid fa-graduation-cap\"></i> function class at the top of the settings panel. Just follow along and quit at any time. </p>",
+  "第一步：配置 API（填写）": "Step 1: Configure API (fill in)",
+  "<p>生成选项使用<strong>独立的 API 配置</strong>，与酒馆主对话的 API 互不影响。<strong>框住的就是需要填写的区域</strong>：</p>\n<p>依次填<strong>配置名称</strong>（随便起，用于区分多套配置）、<strong>API 地址</strong>（OpenAI 兼容接口）、<strong>密钥</strong>、<strong>模型名称</strong>。填好地址后点右侧「拉取」可自动获取可用模型列表，点击即选中；温度 / Token 等保持默认即可。</p>": "The <p> generation option uses <strong> independent API to configure </strong>, and the API in the conversation with SillyTavern owner does not affect each other. The area framed by <strong> is the area that needs to be filled in. </strong>: </p>\n<p> fills in the <strong> configuration name </strong> (arbitrarily used to distinguish multiple sets of configurations), <strong>API address </strong> (OpenAI compatible interface), <strong> key </strong>, and <strong> model name </strong>. After filling in the address, click \"Pull\" on the right to automatically obtain a list of available models. Click to select; just keep the defaults such as temperature/Token. </p>",
+  "第一步：配置 API（保存）": "Step 1: Configure API (Save)",
+  "<p>信息填完后，点<strong>这个「保存」按钮</strong>。⚠️ 不点保存不会生效，切换页面也不会自动保存。</p>\n<p>保存成功后这里会亮起 ✓，并自动进入下一步。</p>": "After filling in the <p> information, click the \"Save\" button <strong></strong>. ⚠️ It will not take effect if you don’t click save, and it will not save automatically when switching pages. </p>\nAfter <p> is successfully saved, ✓ will light up here and automatically enter the next step. </p>",
+  "第二步：确认条目就绪": "Step 2: Confirm the entry is ready",
+  "<p>生成的素材来自<strong>条目池</strong>（条目库 + 抽取配置）。全新安装已内置一组示例条目和默认配置，<strong>开箱即用，无需任何操作</strong>。</p>\n<p>想自定义条目（手动编写或 AI 批量生成）时，随时从功能课堂的「条目池」章节学习，这里不展开。</p>": "The material generated by <p> comes from the <strong> entry pool </strong> (entry library + extraction configuration). A fresh installation has a set of example entries and default configuration built-in, so <strong> works right out of the box, and no operation is required on </strong>. </p>\n<p> When you want to customize items (manually written or AI generated in batches), you can learn from the \"Item Pool\" chapter of the Function Classroom at any time, which will not be expanded here. </p>",
+  "最后一步：生成你的第一组选项": "Final step: generate your first set of options",
+  "<p>配置完成！点面板右上角 <strong>×</strong> 关闭设置。生成入口在<strong>聊天流内的选项面板</strong>上：点面板头部右侧的 <strong>✨ 生成图标</strong>，或者什么都不做——AI 每次回复完成后会<strong>自动生成</strong>一组选项（默认开启）。</p>\n<p>注意：选项面板只出现在与 AI 的对话中，当前聊天里还没有 AI 回复时先发一条消息。生成成功后会自动进入最后一步。</p>": "<p> configuration completed! Click <strong>×</strong> in the upper right corner of the panel to close the settings. The generation entrance is on the options panel </strong> in the <strong> chat flow: click the <strong>✨ generate icon </strong> on the right side of the panel head, or do nothing - AI A set of options will be automatically generated after each reply is completed (enabled by default). </p>\n<p> Note: The options panel only appears in conversations with AI. If there is no reply from AI in the current chat, send a message first. After successful generation, it will automatically enter the final step. </p>",
+  "完成！": "Done!",
+  "<p>核心链路到此打通：API 已就绪，你已经能收到（或马上会收到）第一组行动选项了。</p>\n<p>想深入了解某个功能：题首的 <i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-question\"></i> 查看当前子区要点；题首的 <i class=\"fa-solid fa-graduation-cap\"></i> 打开功能课堂，按章节学习条目池、提示词、世界书等进阶玩法。</p>\n<p><strong>祝游玩愉快！</strong></p>": "The <p> core link is now open: API is ready, and you have received (or will receive soon) the first set of action options. </p>\n<p> wants to learn more about a certain function: <i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-question\"></i> at the beginning of the question to view the key points of the current sub-area; <i class=\"fa-solid fa-graduation-cap\"></i> at the beginning of the question to open the function class and learn advanced gameplay such as entry pool, prompt words, and World Info by chapter. </p>\n<p><strong> wish you a happy trip! </strong></p>",
+  "条目库与配置的两层结构、往配置里勾选条目": "Two-layer structure of item library and configuration, check items in the configuration",
+  "条目池：两层结构": "Entry pool: two-tier structure",
+  "<p>条目池分两层：<strong>条目库</strong>存放所有条目——每条 = 一个行动方向的写作指引；<strong>配置</strong>决定本次生成从哪些条目里抽取，并可绑定到角色或聊天（优先级：聊天 &gt; 角色 &gt; 默认配置）。</p>\n<p>全新安装已内置一组示例条目和默认配置，<strong>开箱即用</strong>。下面带你逛一圈条目库。</p>": "The <p> entry pool is divided into two layers: <strong> entry library </strong> stores all entries - each entry = a writing guide for a direction of action; <strong> configuration </strong> determines which entries are extracted from this generation, and can be bound to a role or chat (priority: chat &gt; role &gt; default configuration). </p>\nA new installation of <p> has built-in a set of sample entries and default configurations, and <strong> can be used with </strong> out of the box. Let’s take you around the entry library. </p>",
+  "条目库布局与功能": "Item library layout and functionality",
+  "<p>我已经帮你打开了条目库。<strong>顶部一排按钮</strong>：全部展开、新建分组、导入 / 导出文件。</p>\n<p><strong>下方按分组存放条目</strong>：分组头可重命名、加条目、整组复制 / 删除；点条目展开可编辑<strong>类型、内容、规则</strong>，勾选框用于批量选中。</p>\n<p>看完点右上角 × 关闭，回到条目池页。</p>": "<p> I have opened the entry library for you. <strong> Top row of buttons </strong>: Expand all, create new groups, import/export files. </p>\nThe entries </strong> are stored in groups below <p><strong>: the group header can be renamed, entries added, and the entire group copied/delete; click on the entry to expand it to edit the <strong> type, content, and rules </strong>, and the check box is used for batch selection. </p>\nAfter reading <p>, click × in the upper right corner to close and return to the entry pool page. </p>",
+  "往配置里加条目": "Add entries to configuration",
+  "<p>条目库是仓库，<strong>配置</strong>才决定\"这次生成用哪些\"。现在<strong>点这个「添加条目」按钮</strong>——它会弹出选择条目界面，下一步我会聚焦给你看。</p>\n<p>想移出某条：在配置的已选列表里点条目右侧的 <i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i>；想整批调整，重新打开这个按钮取消勾选即可。</p>": "The <p> entry library is a warehouse, and <strong> configures </strong> to decide \"which ones to use for this generation\". Now <strong> click the \"Add Entry\" button </strong> - it will pop up the selection entry interface, and I will focus on it for you in the next step. </p>\n<p> If you want to remove a certain item: Click <i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\"></i> on the right side of the item in the selected list of the configuration; if you want to adjust the entire batch, just reopen this button and uncheck it. </p>",
+  "勾选条目并确认": "Check the items and confirm",
+  "<p>这就是<strong>「选择条目」</strong>界面：点分组名展开，勾选要参与生成的条目（分组头的复选框可整组全选），点底部<strong>「确认」</strong>写入当前配置。</p>\n<p>底部实时显示已选数量；确认后回到条目池页就能看到它们。之后想增减，随时点「添加条目」回来改。</p>": "<p> This is the <strong> \"Select Items\" </strong> interface: click on the group name to expand, check the items you want to participate in the generation (the check box in the group header can select the entire group), click on the bottom <strong> \"Confirm\" </strong> to write the current configuration. </p>\nThe selected quantity is displayed in real time at the bottom of <p>; after confirmation, you can see them by returning to the entry pool page. If you want to add or subtract later, you can click \"Add Entry\" to come back and make changes at any time. </p>",
+  "生成与点击行为": "Generation and click behavior",
+  "自动生成、点击行为三模式、数量与字数": "Automatic generation, three modes of click behavior, quantity and Character count",
+  "自动生成与输入润色": "Automatic generation and input polishing",
+  "<p><strong>「自动生成」开关</strong>是全局设置：打开后每次 AI 回复完成都会自动出一组选项，不用手动点。</p>\n<p><strong>「启用输入润色」开关</strong>：发送你的消息前，AI 先把你的输入改写成多个润色版本供挑选，选中的才真正发出。</p>\n<p>两个都建议保持开启。</p>": "<p><strong> The \"auto-generate\" switch </strong> is a global setting: after it is turned on, a set of options will automatically appear every time the AI reply is completed, so there is no need to click it manually. </p>\n<p><strong> \"Enable input polishing\" switch </strong>: Before sending your message, AI rewrites your input into multiple polished versions for selection, and the selected one is actually sent. </p>\nIt is recommended to keep both <p> on. </p>",
+  "<p><strong>点击行为</strong>决定你点一条选项后发生什么：</p>\n<p><strong>发送</strong>——直接把这条选项作为消息发出；<strong>覆盖</strong>——填入输入框并替换已有内容，你可以先改再发；<strong>尾附</strong>——追加到输入框末尾，保留你自己写的内容；<strong>插入</strong>——插到输入框光标所在位置，保留光标前后的文字。</p>\n<p>这里的设置与选项面板头部的切换按钮保持同步，聊天中随时可改。</p>": "<p><strong>Click behavior</strong> determines what happens after you click on an option:</p>\n<p><strong> sends </strong> - directly send this option as a message; <strong> covers </strong> - fill in the input box and replace the existing content, you can change it first and then send it ; <strong> appended to </strong> - append to the end of the input box, retaining your own written content; <strong> inserted into </strong> - inserted into the input box at the cursor position, retaining the text before and after the cursor. </p>\nThe settings here in <p> are synchronized with the switch button at the head of the options panel, and can be changed at any time during chat. </p>",
+  "数量、字数与人称": "Quantity, Character count and person",
+  "<p><strong>生成数量</strong>：填数字 = 每次固定条数，填区间 = 每次随机（如 <code>3-6</code>）；<strong>润色版本数</strong>同理。</p>\n<p>往下还有<strong>每条字数</strong>（选项 / 润色的字数区间，中文字符）和<strong>人称视角</strong>（默认第三人称，可改成第一人称 / 第二人称）。</p>\n<p>这些都有默认值，按喜好微调即可。</p>": "<p><strong> generates the quantity </strong>: fill in the number = fixed number each time, fill in the interval = random each time (such as <code>3-6</code>); the same is true for the number of polished versions of <strong> and </strong>. </p>\nFollowing <p>, there are <strong>, </strong> (Character count range for options/polishing, characters) and <strong>, person perspective, </strong> (default third person, can be changed to first person/second person). </p>\n<p> has default values for these, you can fine-tune them according to your preference. </p>",
+  "模块化提示词的排序、启停与编辑": "Sorting, starting, stopping and editing of modular prompt words",
+  "提示词：选项提示词怎么组装": "Prompt words: How to assemble option prompt words",
+  "<p>选项内容由这里的<strong>提示词模块</strong>驱动：<strong>顶部工具栏</strong>可切换上下文轮数模式；下方是模块列表，可拖拽排序、编辑内容。</p>\n<p>默认配置开箱即用，新手无需改动；想调整时点 <i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-question\"></i> 查看本子区说明。</p>": "The <p> option content is driven by the <strong> prompt word module </strong> here: <strong> top toolbar </strong> can switch the context round mode; below is the module list, which can be dragged and sorted to edit content. </p>\nThe default configuration of <p> is ready to use out of the box, and novices do not need to change it; if you want to adjust <i class=\"fa-solid fa-circle-question\"></i>, please refer to the instructions in this sub-area. </p>",
+  "注入开关、全局排除与逐书三态选择": "Injection switch, global exclusion and book-by-book three-state selection",
+  "世界书：启用开关": "World Info: enable switch",
+  "<p><strong>「启用世界书」</strong>是总开关：开着，生成选项时就会注入当前角色 / 聊天挂载的世界书设定，选项更贴合世界观。</p>\n<p>「刷新列表」按钮用于同步酒馆侧的世界书变更（新建 / 删除书之后点一下）。</p>\n<p>下面两步分别讲<strong>如何排除世界书</strong>和<strong>如何选择世界书</strong>。</p>": "<p><strong> \"Enable World Info\" </strong> is the master switch: on, when generating options, the World Info settings mounted by the current character/chat will be injected, and the options will be more consistent with the world view. </p>\n<p> The \"Refresh List\" button is used to synchronize changes in the World Info on SillyTavern side (click it after creating/deleting a book). </p>\n<p> The following two steps will explain how <strong> excludes World Info </strong> and <strong> how to select World Info </strong>. </p>",
+  "世界书：如何排除": "World Info: How to exclude",
+  "<p>不想让某本书影响生成的选项？用<strong>「全局排除」</strong>：点标题展开，在搜索框输入书名，点右侧<strong>「添加」</strong>——被排除的书在<strong>所有聊天中</strong>永久不被选项生成参考。</p>\n<p>反悔了就点书名右侧的<strong>「移除」</strong>撤销排除。</p>": "<p> Don't want a certain book to affect the generated options? Use <strong> \"Global Exclusion\" </strong>: Click the title to expand it, enter the book title in the search box, and click \"Add\" on the right <strong> </strong> - the excluded book will never be selected as a reference in all <strong> chats. </p>\nIf <p> regrets it, click <strong> \"Remove\" </strong> on the right side of the book title to undo the exclusion. </p>",
+  "世界书：如何选择": "World Info: How to Choose",
+  "<p><strong>已启用的世界书</strong>列表里，每本书左侧是灯色（🔵 常驻条目 / 🟢 关键词触发），右侧徽章标明来源（全局 / 角色）。</p>\n<p>书名右侧的<strong>三态框</strong>点击循环：<strong>关</strong>（本书完全不参与）→ <strong>跟随</strong>（按酒馆的条目启用状态）→ <strong>强制</strong>（本书全部条目参与）→ <strong>自定义</strong>（展开后逐条勾选）。展开书名还能看到每个条目的状态并单独勾选。</p>\n<p>「未启用的世界书」区里的书点<strong>「启用」</strong>即可加入。若当前没有启用的世界书，本步无可聚焦的列表，先了解即可。</p>": "<p><strong> In the list of enabled World Infos </strong>, the left side of each book is the light color (🔵 permanent entry / 🟢 keyword trigger), and the right badge indicates the source (global / role). </p>\n<p>Click the <strong>mode box</strong> beside a book to cycle through <strong>Off</strong> (exclude the book) → <strong>Follow</strong> (follow SillyTavern’s enabled entries) → <strong>Force</strong> (include every entry) → <strong>Custom</strong> (expand and select individual entries). Expanding a book also shows each entry’s status and selection.</p>\n<p>Click <strong>Enable</strong> beside a book in “Disabled World Info” to add it. If no books are enabled yet, there is no list to focus on during this step; you can simply review the guidance.</p>",
+  "标签提取一键提取标签内容；三个分区与正则库进阶清洗；顶部开关控制是否先走酒馆正则": "Tag extraction: One-click extraction of tag content; advanced cleaning of three partitions and regular library; top switch controls whether to use the pub regular first",
+  "过滤：标签提取与三个分区": "Filtering: tag extraction with three partitions",
+  "<p><strong>过滤是干什么的</strong>：发送生成请求前，插件先按你定的规则清洗聊天记录——删掉思维链、小剧场等不该让\"出选项的 AI\"看到的内容。</p>\n<p><strong>新手推荐「标签提取」</strong>：在过滤页顶部<strong>只填标签名</strong>，插件自动按 <code>&lt;名字&gt;…&lt;/名字&gt;</code> 配对。例如卡里的剧情包在 <code>&lt;正文&gt;…&lt;/正文&gt;</code> 里，就填「正文」——发送时<strong>只保留 AI 输出里 &lt;正文&gt;…&lt;/正文&gt; 段落（含标签本身）</strong>，其余 AI 输出丢弃；用户输入原样保留。提取规则独立存放、独立启停，<strong>不会混入下方任何正则分区</strong>。</p>\n<p>进阶规则按三个分区管理：<strong>① 全局正则区</strong>（始终生效）&emsp;<strong>② 预设正则区</strong>（随酒馆预设切换）&emsp;<strong>③ 角色卡正则区</strong>（随角色卡切换）；不属于当前预设 / 角色的分组会<strong>半透明显示</strong>且不生效。执行顺序恒定：<strong>先提取、后过滤</strong>——标签匹配 / 正则在提取结果上继续删除不要的部分，二者配合不打架。</p>": "What does <p><strong> filtering do? </strong>: Before sending a generation request, the plug-in first cleans the chat history according to the rules you set - delete content such as thought chains, mini theaters, etc. that should not be seen by \"AI who has no options\". </p>\n<p><strong> Beginners recommend \"tag extraction\" </strong>: fill in only the tag name </strong> at the top of the filter page <strong>, and the plug-in will automatically match <code>&lt;name&gt;…&lt;/name&gt;</code>. For example, if the plot package in Cary is in <code>&lt;Text&gt;…&lt;/Text&gt;</code>, just fill in “Text”—when sending, <strong> will only be kept in AI output. &lt;Text&gt;…&lt;/Text&gt; Paragraph (including the tag itself) </strong>, the rest AI is discarded from the output; user input is retained as is. The extraction rules are stored independently and can be started and stopped independently. <strong> will not be mixed into any regular partition </strong> below. </p>\n<p> advanced rules are managed according to three partitions: <strong>① Global regular area </strong> (always effective) &emsp;<strong>② Default regular area </strong> (switched with SillyTavern default)&emsp;<strong>③ Regular area of the character card (switched with the character card); groups that do not belong to the current default/role will be displayed semi-transparently and will not take effect. The execution order is constant: <strong> is extracted first, and then </strong> is filtered - label matching/regular continues to delete unnecessary parts of the extraction results, and the two work together without fighting. </p>",
+  "过滤：正则库与规则长什么样": "Filtering: What do regular libraries and rules look like?",
+  "<p>我已帮你打开正则库——所有过滤规则集中存放在这里，按分组整理。<strong>顶部一排按钮</strong>：全部展开、新建分组、导入 / 导出文件，以及<strong>云下载「从酒馆导入」</strong>（下一步细讲）。</p>\n<p>分组头的 <i class=\"fa-solid fa-plus\"></i> 新增一条规则。一条规则 = <strong>匹配模式</strong>（正则表达式或标签名）+ <strong>替换文本</strong>（留空 = 命中即整段删除，填了 = 替换成该文本）。</p>": "<p> I have opened the regular library for you - all filtering rules are stored here and organized into groups. <strong> The top row of buttons </strong>: Expand all, create a new group, import/export files, and <strong> cloud download \"Import from the pub\" </strong> (more details next). </p>\nA new rule is added for <i class=\"fa-solid fa-plus\"></i> in the <p> group header. A rule = <strong> matches the pattern </strong> (regular expression or tag name) + <strong> replaces the text </strong> (leave blank = if hit, the entire paragraph will be deleted, filled = replace with the text). </p>",
+  "过滤：从酒馆导入正则": "Filter: Import regular expressions from SillyTavern",
+  "<p>点<strong>这个云下载按钮</strong>：可以从酒馆的<strong>全局正则 / 当前预设 / 当前角色卡</strong>三个区域勾选已有正则，批量导入到插件正则库，导入时选择存放的分组。</p>\n<p>你没有要导入的内容也没关系，直接点「下一步」。</p>": "<p> Click the <strong> cloud download button </strong>: You can check the existing rules from the three areas of SillyTavern: Global Rules / Current Preset / Current Character Card </strong>, and import them into the plug-in regular library in batches. Select the group to be stored when importing. </p>\n<p> It doesn’t matter if you don’t have any content to import, just click “Next”. </p>",
+  "过滤：在分区中引用": "Filter: Referenced in Partition",
+  "<p>库里的正则不会直接生效，要<strong>被分区中的分组引用</strong>才参与过滤：</p>\n<p>① 点分区右侧<strong>「新增分组」</strong>；② 点分组上的<strong>「从正则库添加」</strong>（下面聚焦的是第一个分组的该按钮）；③ 勾选要用的正则并确认，保持分组勾选启用即可。</p>\n<p>也可以点分组上的 <i class=\"fa-solid fa-plus\"></i> 跳过正则库直接写内联规则。没有分组时先建一个，我再聚焦给你看。</p>": "The regular rules in the <p> library will not take effect directly. <strong> must be referenced by the group in the partition and </strong> can participate in filtering: </p>\n<p> ① Click <strong> \"Add New Group\" </strong> on the right side of the partition; ② Click <strong> \"Add from Regular Library\" </strong> on the group (the focus below is the button of the first group); ③ Check the regular rule to be used and confirm, and keep the group checked and enabled. </p>\n<p> You can also click <i class=\"fa-solid fa-plus\"></i> on the group to skip the regular library and write inline rules directly. If there is no group, create one first and I will focus it for you. </p>",
+  "悬浮球、面板停靠位置、主题与字体": "Floating ball, panel docking position, theme and font",
+  "外观：面板与悬浮球": "Appearance: Panel and suspended ball",
+  "<p><strong>「悬浮窗」开关</strong>控制屏幕右下角的悬浮球——单击呼出选项弹窗（无需滚动到聊天底部），<strong>右键 / 长按</strong>可查看选项、打开设置或隐藏悬浮球。也可把单击改为直接出设置。</p>\n<p><strong>聊天界面</strong>分区的「选项面板」控制聊天流内的选项面板：关闭后改用悬浮球弹窗查看选项，输入润色同步隐藏；停靠位置可选<strong>聊天内</strong>（跟随最新楼层下方）或<strong>输入框上方</strong>（固定不滚、选项再多不占满屏）。</p>": "<p><strong> \"floating window\" switch </strong> controls the floating ball in the lower right corner of the screen - click to call out the options pop-up window (no need to scroll to the bottom of the chat), <strong> right click / long press </strong> to view options, open settings or hide the floating ball. You can also change the click to directly exit the settings. </p>\n<p><strong> The \"option panel\" in the </strong> partition of the chat interface controls the option panel in the chat flow: after closing, use the floating ball pop-up window to view options, and input polish to hide simultaneously; the docking position can be </strong> in <strong> chat (follow the latest floor below) or </strong> above the <strong> input box (fixed without scrolling, no matter how many options there are, it will not fill the screen). </p>",
+  "外观：主题与字体": "Appearance: Themes and Fonts",
+  "<p><strong>主题</strong>五种模式：<strong>自动</strong>（检测酒馆亮暗）、<strong>跟随</strong>（完全用酒馆配色）、强制<strong>暗色 / 亮色</strong>，以及<strong>独立预设主题</strong>（黄昏 / 樱花 / 青瓷 / 蜜糖，与插件面板头部的循环切换按钮互通）。</p>\n<p><strong>字体大小</strong>默认跟随设备（手机小号、桌面中号），点具体档位即固定；想改回去点「自动」。</p>\n<p>另外：<strong>输入润色</strong>的开关与版本数在「生成」页，发送消息前可用 AI 把你的输入改写成多个润色版本。</p>": "<p><strong> theme </strong> five modes: <strong> automatic </strong> (detect the light and dark of SillyTavern), <strong> follow </strong> (completely use SillyTavern color), forced <strong> dark/bright color </strong>, and <strong> independent preset theme </strong> (dusk / cherry blossom / Celadon/honey, interconnected with the cycle switch button at the top of the plug-in panel). </p>\n<p><strong> The font size </strong> defaults to follow the device (small size for mobile phone, medium size for desktop). Click the specific gear to fix it; if you want to change it back, click \"Auto\". </p>\n<p> In addition: <strong> Input polishing </strong>'s switch and version number are on the \"Generate\" page. You can use AI to rewrite your input into multiple polished versions before sending a message. </p>",
+  "条目池 = 条目库（存所有条目）+ 配置（决定本次生成从哪些条目抽取）。": "Entry pool = entry library (stores all entries) + configuration (determines which entries are extracted from this generation).",
+  "配置从条目库中勾选条目，生成时 AI 从当前生效的配置里抽取条目作为写作素材。": "The configuration selects items from the item library. When generating, AI extracts items from the currently effective configuration as writing materials.",
+  "配置可绑定到聊天或角色，优先级：聊天绑定 > 角色绑定 > 默认配置，命中即用、不合并。": "Configuration can be bound to chat or role, priority: chat binding > role binding > default configuration, hit and use, not merged.",
+  "操作流程：新建配置 → 「添加条目」勾选 → 绑定聊天/角色，下次生成自动生效。": "Operation process: Create new configuration → Check \"Add entry\" → Bind chat/role, it will automatically take effect next time it is generated.",
+  "全新安装已内置一组示例条目与默认配置，开箱即用；条目库支持导入/导出与分组管理。": "The new installation has a set of sample entries and default configuration built-in, ready to use out of the box; the entry library supports import/export and group management.",
+  "控制选项怎么生成、点选一条之后发生什么。": "Control how options are generated and what happens after clicking one.",
+  "自动生成（全局设置，对所有聊天生效）：每次 AI 回复完成后自动出一组选项，无需手动点。": "Automatically generated (global setting, effective for all chats): A set of options will automatically appear after each AI reply is completed, no need to click manually.",
+  "输入润色：发送前把你的输入改写成多个润色版本供挑选，选中的才真正发出。": "Input polishing: Rewrite your input into multiple polished versions for selection before sending, and the selected one will be sent out.",
+  "点击行为：发送 = 直接发出；覆盖 = 替换输入框内容（可先改再发）；尾附 = 追加到输入框末尾；插入 = 插到光标处（保留已有内容）。": "Click behavior: send = send directly; overwrite = replace the content of the input box (you can change it first and then send); append = append to the end of the input box; insert = insert at the cursor (keep the existing content).",
+  "点击行为与选项面板头部的切换按钮保持同步，聊天中随时可改。": "The click behavior is synchronized with the toggle button at the head of the options panel and can be changed at any time during chat.",
+  "数量支持固定值或区间（如 3-6 = 每次随机）；往下还有每条字数与人称视角。": "The quantity supports fixed values or intervals (such as 3-6 = random each time); further down, there is also the word number and person perspective of each item.",
+  "选项内容由模块化提示词驱动，默认配置开箱即用；编辑器里看到的模块内容就是实际发送给 AI 的提示词。": "The option content is driven by modular prompt words, and the default configuration is available out of the box; the module content seen in the editor is the prompt word actually sent to AI.",
+  "模块按角色分段：system = 系统指令，user = 素材与上下文，assistant = 格式起手式（默认模块均为 system，不依赖模型预填充能力；想要预填充式效果可把个别模块角色改为 assistant，提前铺好回复开头）；可拖拽排序、启停、编辑。": "Modules are segmented by role: system = system command, user = material and context, assistant = format start (the default modules are all system, which does not rely on model pre-filling capabilities; if you want a pre-filling effect, you can change the role of individual modules to assistant and lay out the beginning of the reply in advance); you can drag and drop to sort, start, stop, and edit.",
+  "默认提示词已把场景锚定、信息边界、方向差异等基础原则收进核心规则，不再拆成一排相互叠加的规则开关；需要改时直接编辑核心规则。": "The default prompt words have incorporated basic principles such as scene anchoring, information boundaries, and directional differences into core rules, and are no longer split into a row of superimposed rule switches; edit the core rules directly when changes are needed.",
+  "{{user}} 等酒馆宏仍由酒馆引擎替换（各角色模块内均同样执行）；插件自己的占位符（如 {{count}}、{{pool_selected}}）会在发送前替换为本轮实际值。": "Tavern macros such as {{user}} are still replaced by SillyTavern engine (executed equally in each character module); the plug-in's own placeholders (such as {{count}}, {{pool_selected}}) will be replaced with the actual values of this round before being sent.",
+  "上下文轮数决定带多少历史消息给生成选项的 AI。": "The number of context rounds determines how many history messages are brought to the AI generation option.",
+  "🔒 标记的不可编辑模块由系统自动管理（世界书条目、角色描述等注入项）。": "🔒 Marked non-editable modules are automatically managed by the system (injections such as World Info entries, character descriptions, etc.).",
+  "防重复：提示词不再注入上一轮选项（防污染），生成后自动剔除与上一 AI 楼层/当前楼既有版本重复的选项——同标题需内容也相似才剔除，不同标题按正文相似度判定，不足时自动补齐（最多 2 轮）。": "Anti-duplication: Prompt words will no longer be injected into the previous round of options (anti-pollution). After generation, options that are duplicates of the previous AI floor/current floor will be automatically eliminated - the same title will only be eliminated if the content is similar. Different titles will be judged based on text similarity and will be automatically filled in if insufficient (up to 2 round).",
+  "配置生成选项所用的独立 AI 接口，与酒馆主对话的 API 互不影响。": "A separate AI interface used to configure generation options, independent of the API used to talk to SillyTavern owner.",
+  "必填四项：配置名称、API 地址（OpenAI 兼容接口）、密钥、模型名称。": "Four items are required: configuration name, API address (OpenAI compatible interface), key, and model name.",
+  "填完地址点「拉取」可自动获取可用模型列表，点击即选中。": "After filling in the address, click \"Pull\" to automatically obtain a list of available models. Click to select.",
+  "⚠️ 修改后必须点「保存」才会生效，切换页面或关闭窗口不会自动保存。": "⚠️ You must click \"Save\" after modification to take effect. Switching pages or closing the window will not save automatically.",
+  "未配置 API 时无法生成选项（悬浮球会变暗提示）。": "Options cannot be generated when API is not configured (the floating ball will dim the prompt).",
+  "控制哪些世界书条目注入选项生成的提示词，让选项贴合世界观。": "Control which World Info entries are injected into the prompt words generated by the options, so that the options fit the world view.",
+  "「启用世界书」是总开关，关闭则完全不注入。": "\"Enable World Info\" is the master switch. If it is turned off, it will not be injected at all.",
+  "每本书三态循环：关（完全不参与）→ 跟随（按酒馆条目启用状态）→ 强制（全部参与）；展开书名可进入自定义逐条勾选。": "Each book has a three-state cycle: Off (no participation at all) → Follow (enabled by tavern entry) → Forced (all participation); expand the book title to enter custom check items one by one.",
+  "「全局排除」的书在所有聊天中永久不被参考，可随时移除撤销。": "\"Globally excluded\" books will never be referenced in all chats and can be removed and revoked at any time.",
+  "🔵 蓝灯 = 常驻条目（始终注入），🟢 绿灯 = 关键词触发（匹配时注入）。": "🔵 Blue light = resident entry (always injected), 🟢 Green light = keyword triggered (injected on match).",
+  "SP·数据库 的注入目标世界书需在提示词页开启「数据库」开关才会参与选项生成：蓝灯索引/概要条目始终注入，绿灯记忆条目靠关键词命中激活，扫描深度与酒馆主生成一致。聊天绑定的书在此页会显示「聊天」徽章，「数据库」开关可显式控制目标书的参与。": "The injection target World Info of SP·Database needs to turn on the \"Database\" switch on the prompt word page to participate in option generation: blue light index/summary entries are always injected, green light memory entries are activated by keyword hits, and the scanning depth is consistent with SillyTavern owner's generation. Books bound to chat will display the \"Chat\" badge on this page, and the \"Database\" switch can explicitly control the participation of the target book.",
+  "新建/删除世界书后点「刷新列表」同步酒馆侧变更。": "After creating/deleting the World Info, click \"Refresh List\" to synchronize the changes on SillyTavern side.",
+  "生成前按规则清洗聊天记录。新手用顶部「标签提取」，页顶开关控制是否先走酒馆正则。": "Clean chat records according to rules before generation. Newbies use the \"Tag Extraction\" at the top, and the switch at the top of the page controls whether to take SillyTavern rule first.",
+  "「标签提取」（页顶）只填标签名：填「正文」即保留 <正文>…</正文> 段落发给 AI，其余丢弃；多条提取取并集。": "In \"Tag Extraction\" (top of page), only fill in the tag name: fill in \"Text\" to keep the <Text>...</Text> paragraph and send it to AI, and discard the rest; multiple extractions are combined.",
+  "「走酒馆正则」开关：开（默认）= 先过酒馆全局/预设/角色卡正则，再过本页规则；关 = 只用本页规则，逃生舱：预设正则清空旧层 user 输入导致 assistant 合并时关掉。": "\"Go to SillyTavern rules\" switch: On (default) = First go through SillyTavern global/default/character card rules, and then go through the rules on this page; Off = Only use the rules on this page, escape hatch: Default rules clear the old layer. Turn off when user input causes assistant to be merged.",
+  "提取功能只在页顶快速区，独立存放、独立启停——三个正则分区与正则库只做「过滤」（删除/替换），不出现提取规则。": "The extraction function is only in the quick area at the top of the page, with independent storage and independent start and stop - the three regular partitions and the regular library only perform \"filtering\" (deletion/replacement), and no extraction rules appear.",
+  "执行顺序恒定：先提取、后过滤——分区规则在提取结果上继续删除不要的部分，二者配合不打架。": "The execution order is constant: extract first, then filter - the partition rules continue to delete unnecessary parts of the extraction results, and the two work together without fighting.",
+  "三个分区：全局正则区（始终生效）、预设正则区（随酒馆预设切换）、角色卡正则区（随角色卡切换）。": "Three zones: global regular zone (always in effect), default regular zone (switched with SillyTavern default), and character card regular zone (switched with the character card).",
+  "不属于当前预设/角色的分组会半透明显示且不生效，顶部状态栏显示当前实际生效的分组数。": "Groups that do not belong to the current preset/role will be displayed semi-transparently and will not take effect. The top status bar displays the number of groups that are actually currently in effect.",
+  "规则集中存放在正则库，需被分区中的分组引用后才生效；分组上也可直接添加内联规则（标签匹配/正则）。": "The rules are centrally stored in the regular library and need to be referenced by the group in the partition to take effect; inline rules (label matching/regular) can also be added directly to the group.",
+  "「从酒馆导入」可从酒馆的全局/预设/角色卡三区批量导入已有正则。": "\"Import from SillyTavern\" can batch import existing rules from the global/default/character card areas of SillyTavern.",
+  "行动选项的生成/选择计数、趋势与排行榜，支持按条目池配置分维度查看与一键应用优选建议。": "The generation/selection count, trends and rankings of action options support dimensional viewing and one-click application of preferred recommendations by item pool configuration.",
+  "顶部可切换统计维度：「全局」（所有配置混合累计）或某个条目池配置（仅该配置生效会话计入）；未绑定任何配置的会话单独记入「未绑定配置」档。": "The statistics dimension can be switched at the top: \"Global\" (all configurations are mixed and accumulated) or a certain entry pool configuration (only sessions in which this configuration is effective are counted); sessions that are not bound to any configuration are recorded separately in the \"Unbound Configuration\" file.",
+  "只计行动选项视图：AI 每轮成功生成并展示的选项计生成，用户点击应用计选择；润色（enrich）完全不计入。": "Only action options view: AI Options successfully generated and displayed in each round are not counted as generated, and the user clicks Apply to count the selection; polish (enrich) is not counted at all.",
+  "「趋势」按天展示生成/选择活动（7/30 天可切换，随选中维度），自 v51 起累积，历史不回填；卡片提供活跃天数、池内参与率与最近统计时间。": "\"Trend\" displays generated/selected activities by day (7/30 days can be switched, and the dimension can be selected at will), accumulated since v51, and the history is not backfilled; the card provides the number of active days, pool participation rate and the latest statistical time.",
+  "条目榜命中率与「期望」对比：期望 = 按每轮选项数推算的随机基准（4 条时 25%、10 条时 10%），高于期望越多越值得提权，低于越多越值得降权；单个配置维度还显示近 10 轮窗口命中率（50 轮滚动窗口）。": "Comparison of entry list hit rate and \"expectation\": Expectation = random benchmark calculated based on the number of options in each round (25% when 4 entries, 10% when 10 entries), the more it is higher than the expectation, the more worthy of a power increase, the more lower than the expectation, the more worthy of a downgrade; a single configuration dimension also shows the hit rate of the nearly 10 round window (50 round rolling window).",
+  "洞察标签仅提示不改权重，但可一键应用：样本充足（≥10 轮）且明显低于期望 →「候选降权」，明显高于期望 →「表现良好」，低于默认权重的条目会在中性时自动提议「权重回捞」逐步恢复；自动化永不自动停用条目（只调权重）。点标签旁的对勾或「应用全部建议」把权重修改写入当前配置（可撤销）。": "The insight label only prompts that the weight should not be changed, but can be applied with one click: sufficient samples (≥10 rounds) and significantly lower than expectations → \"candidate downweight\", significantly higher than expectations → \"good performance\", items with lower than default weights will automatically propose \"weight recovery\" when neutral and gradually recover; automation will never automatically deactivate items (only adjust weights). Click the check mark next to the label or \"Apply all suggestions\" to write the weight modification into the current configuration (can be undone).",
+  "「样本分布」按当前维度有效池展示样本充足/不足/从未参与三档，充足占比越高，优化建议越可信。": "\"Sample Distribution\" displays three levels of samples according to the current dimension's effective pool: sufficient/insufficient/never participated. The higher the sufficient proportion, the more credible the optimization suggestions are.",
+  "「导出 JSON」下载完整统计（各维度总量、逐日计数、条目统计与条目库 join 信息）；「清空统计」清空全部维度，不可撤销。": "\"Export JSON\" downloads complete statistics (total amount of each dimension, daily count, item statistics and item database join information); \"Clear Statistics\" clears all dimensions and is irrevocable.",
+  "你拥有的卡：可装备到卡组，重复抽到的自动折算行动币。": "The cards you own: can be equipped into the deck, and the cards drawn repeatedly will be automatically converted into action coins.",
+  "这里只列出你已拥有的卡（含内置/套装/角色主题卡），显示星级、类型、触发条件与效果。": "Only the cards you already own are listed here (including built-in/set/character theme cards), showing star rating, type, trigger conditions and effects.",
+  "卡是永久收藏，不会损坏；开卡包抽到已拥有的卡会自动折算小额行动币。": "Cards are permanently collected and will not be damaged; when you open a card pack and draw an already owned card, it will automatically be converted into a small amount of action coins.",
+  "看未拥有卡的全套图鉴与收藏进度，去「收藏」页。": "To see the full set of illustrations and collection progress for cards you don’t own, go to the “Collection” page.",
+  "按当前生效条目池配置编辑 4 个类型槽（武器/法术/祝福/试炼各 1 张），受星级预算约束（3星≤2/4星≤1/5星≤1）。": "Edit 4 type slots (1 each for weapons/spells/blessings/trials) according to the currently effective entry pool configuration, subject to star budget constraints (3 stars ≤ 2/4 stars ≤ 1/5 stars ≤ 1).",
+  "自动编组默认开：从已拥有卡自动填满 4 槽，零管理；点槽位可切手动调整。": "Automatic grouping is on by default: the 4 slot is automatically filled from existing cards, with zero management; the slot position can be manually adjusted.",
+  "同类最多装 1 张；3星≤2、4星≤1、5星≤1，从结构上防强卡叠爆。": "The largest number of 1 cards of its kind; 3 star ≤ 2, 4 star ≤ 1, 5 star ≤ 1, structurally preventing strong card stack explosion.",
+  "点选项判定时，已装备的卡会在满足触发条件时施加效果。": "When clicking the option judgment, the equipped card will apply effects when the trigger conditions are met.",
+  "新手首次启用会自动发放 4 张基础卡让卡组立即满编。": "When a novice starts the game for the first time, 4 basic cards will be automatically issued to make the deck immediately full.",
+  "收藏进度、图鉴与成就：看全部可获得的卡，集齐套装解锁特殊效果。": "Collection progress, illustrations and achievements: See all available cards and collect sets to unlock special effects.",
+  "收藏进度：统计已收集/可收集卡数与各星级分布；内置卡库为完整图鉴。": "Collection progress: statistics on the number of collected/collectable cards and the distribution of each star level; the built-in card library is a complete illustration.",
+  "行动币在页顶：点选项判定按结局增减（大成功+5/成功+2/失败-1/大失败-3），攒够 5 币可开卡包（3 选 1，含角色主题卡）。": "Action coins are at the top of the page: click on the option to determine the increase or decrease according to the ending (big success + 5/success + 2/failure-1/big failure-3). If you save enough 5 coins, you can open a card pack (for 3, choose 1, including character theme cards).",
+  "套装收藏：每套显示收集进度，集齐一套即解锁其特殊效果（装备 ≥2 张成套卡时判定触发）。": "Set collection: Each set displays the collection progress. Collecting one set will unlock its special effects (triggered when ≥2 complete sets of cards are equipped).",
+  "成就：单类型全收集、收藏里程碑、套装集齐达成时自动庆祝一次（历史积压只记录不重复弹）。": "Achievements: Automatically celebrate once when all collections of a single type, collection milestones, and sets are completed (the historical backlog only records and does not replay).",
+  "货币与收藏同属全局进度层，「清空统计」不清除。": "Currency and collections both belong to the global progress layer, and \"Clear Statistics\" will not clear them.",
+  "悬浮窗、聊天界面面板、主题与字体大小。": "Floating window, chat interface panel, theme and font size.",
+  "「悬浮窗」区：开关控制屏幕右下角的悬浮球；单击可选出选项弹窗或出设置（右键 / 长按查看选项或进设置）。": "\"Suspended Window\" area: Switch controls the floating ball in the lower right corner of the screen; click to bring up the options pop-up window or exit settings (right-click/long press to view options or enter settings).",
+  "「聊天界面」区：选项面板开关（关闭后改用悬浮球弹窗查看选项、输入润色同步隐藏）、停靠位置（聊天内 / 输入框上方）、魔棒菜单入口。": "\"Chat interface\" area: option panel switch (after closing, use the floating ball pop-up window to view options, input polishing and synchronization hiding), docking position (in the chat/above the input box), magic wand menu entrance.",
+  "「高级功能」区：提示词、世界书、过滤、调试等进阶子区的显隐开关。": "\"Advanced Functions\" area: Show and hide switches for advanced sub-areas such as prompt words, World Info, filtering, and debugging.",
+  "主题五种模式：自动（检测酒馆亮暗）、跟随酒馆配色、强制暗色/亮色，另有 4 个独立预设主题（黄昏/樱花/青瓷/蜜糖）。": "The theme has five modes: automatic (detecting the light and dark of SillyTavern), following SillyTavern color matching, forced dark/bright color, and 4 independent preset themes (dusk/cherry blossom/celadon/honey).",
+  "字体默认跟随设备（手机小号、桌面中号），点具体档位固定，点「自动」还原。": "The font defaults to follow the device (small size for mobile phone, medium size for desktop). Click the specific gear to fix it, and click \"Automatic\" to restore it.",
+  "版本与统计信息、恢复出厂设置。": "Version and statistical information, factory reset.",
+  "显示当前数据版本和模块、条目等统计信息。": "Displays the current data version and statistical information such as modules and entries.",
+  "恢复出厂会删除所有设置并回到插件初始状态，⚠️ 不可撤销，执行前请先导出提示词备份。": "Factory reset will delete all settings and return to the initial state of the plug-in. ⚠️ It is irrevocable. Please export the prompt word backup before executing.",
+  "所有行动选项条目的总仓库，按分组管理；配置中的条目都是从这里勾选引用的。": "The general warehouse of all action option entries, managed by groups; entries in the configuration are checked and referenced from here.",
+  "点分组名展开/折叠，分组名旁 + 加条目，📋 复制整组；空分组在关闭弹窗时自动清理。": "Click the group name to expand/collapse, click + next to the group name to add an entry, 📋 to copy the entire group; empty groups will be automatically cleared when the pop-up window is closed.",
+  "支持跨分组拖拽条目、拖拽 ☰ 调整顺序。": "Supports dragging items across groups and dragging ☰ to adjust order.",
+  "勾选复选框后点「导出文件」只导出勾选的条目（不勾选则全量导出）。": "After checking the checkbox, click \"Export File\" to export only the checked items (unchecked, all will be exported).",
+  "修改条目库会同步影响所有引用该条目的配置。": "Modifying the entry library will synchronously affect all configurations that reference the entry.",
+  "所有过滤正则的集中存放处，按分组管理，供过滤分区引用。": "Centralized storage of all filtering rules, managed by groups, for reference by filtering partitions.",
+  "点分组名展开/折叠，拖拽左侧把手排序分组或把条目拖入其他分组；分组名旁 + 添加规则。": "Click the group name to expand/collapse, drag the left handle to sort the group or drag items into other groups; + next to the group name to add a rule.",
+  "规则两种类型：标签匹配（剥掉标签对）、正则表达式（支持替换）；「提取」不在库/分区里，只在过滤页顶部。": "There are two types of rules: tag matching (stripping tag pairs), regular expressions (supporting replacement); \"Extract\" is not in the library/partition, only at the top of the filter page.",
+  "顶部工具栏：全部展开/收起、新建分组、文件导入/导出、「从酒馆导入」。": "Top toolbar: Expand/collapse all, create new group, import/export files, \"Import from tavern\".",
+  "「从酒馆导入」可从酒馆全局/预设/角色卡三区勾选已有正则批量导入。": "\"Import from SillyTavern\" can select the existing regular rules from the three areas of SillyTavern global/default/character card to import in batches.",
+  "库里的正则不会直接生效，需在「过滤」页被分区中的分组引用后参与过滤。": "The regular rules in the library will not take effect directly. They need to participate in filtering after the \"Filter\" page is referenced by the group in the partition.",
