+  "顺着场景推演：先辨认角色最新一条行为、对白、动作与场景交互各自抛出了什么，再推演 {{user}} 此刻能够做出的最合理回应——选项就是这次推演的落点，只锚定当下，不回跳旧剧情节点。": "Follow the scene to deduce: first identify what the character's latest behavior, dialogue, action and scene interaction throw out, and then deduce the most reasonable response that {{user}} can make at this moment - the option is the landing point of this deduction, only anchoring the present, and not jumping back to old plot nodes.",
